  "historyNote": "#8547, eff 1-24-06 (formerly He-W 593.23); ss by #9623, eff 12-24-09; ss by #12440, INTERIM, eff 12-23-17, EXPIRED: 6-21-18 New. #12566, eff 6-29-18; ss by #14020, eff 7-10-24",
